2:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"title":"L'équipe","subtitle":"","image":"/rural-retreat-landscape.jpg"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 py-12","children":["",["$","$Lc",null,{"members":[{"id":470,"date":"2025-12-10T04:35:32","date_gmt":"2025-12-10T04:35:32","guid":{"rendered":"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=membre&p=470"},"modified":"2025-12-10T05:36:26","modified_gmt":"2025-12-10T05:36:26","slug":"jean-sylvia","status":"publish","type":"membre","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/","title":{"rendered":"Jean & Sylvia"},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-470","membre","type-membre","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":{"binome_seul":true,"descriptif":"<p>Derrière chaque lieu hybride, il y a toujours une histoire…Celle que murmurent à bas mots ses façades, ses bois, qui transmettent ce que nous sommes. Et celle que l’on porte tout haut aux travers de toutes nos voix et visages !</p>\n<p>Silvia a aujourd’hui 74 ans, elle a franchi le portail de L’Hermitage à 16 ans !</p>\n<p>Jean a grandi sur ce site, et en vrai griot contemporain, il est garant de la mémoire du lieu. Il vous dévoilera tous les secrets de l’Hermitage ! Alors attendez-vous à découvrir 150 ans d’histoire de ce lieu hors norme.</p>\n","photo":{"ID":472,"id":472,"title":"Jean & Sylvia","filename":"Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","filesize":49147,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/jean-sylvia/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"jean-sylvia","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":470,"date":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","modified":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":523,"height":480,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia-300x275.jpeg","medium-width":300,"medium-height":275,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","medium_large-width":523,"medium_large-height":480,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","large-width":523,"large-height":480,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","1536x1536-width":523,"1536x1536-height":480,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jean-Sylvia.jpeg","2048x2048-width":523,"2048x2048-height":480}},"domaine_daction":"","activite_principale":"Fondateurs"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre/470","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/membre"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=470"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":476,"date":"2025-12-10T04:36:27","date_gmt":"2025-12-10T04:36:27","guid":{"rendered":"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=membre&p=476"},"modified":"2025-12-10T05:36:10","modified_gmt":"2025-12-10T05:36:10","slug":"laetitia-genvieve","status":"publish","type":"membre","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/laetitia-genvieve/","title":{"rendered":"Laëtitia & Genviève"},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-476","membre","type-membre","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":{"binome_seul":true,"descriptif":"<p>“Tic & Tac” pour les intimes de L’Hermitage…</p>\n<p>Geneviève et Laëtitia sont les deux faces d’une même pièce précieuse de L’Hermitage : l'hospitalité.</p>\n<p>Ce sont elles qui prépareront votre séjour à vos côtés, vous accueilleront et qui vous feront vous sentir “comme à la maison” !</p>\n","photo":{"ID":473,"id":473,"title":"Laetitia & Genevieve","filename":"Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","filesize":48920,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/laetitia-genevieve/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"laetitia-genevieve","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":470,"date":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","modified":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":527,"height":451,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve-300x257.jpeg","medium-width":300,"medium-height":257,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","medium_large-width":527,"medium_large-height":451,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","large-width":527,"large-height":451,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","1536x1536-width":527,"1536x1536-height":451,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Laetitia-Genevieve.jpeg","2048x2048-width":527,"2048x2048-height":451}},"domaine_daction":"","activite_principale":"Séjours"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre/476","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/membre"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=476"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":477,"date":"2025-12-10T04:37:37","date_gmt":"2025-12-10T04:37:37","guid":{"rendered":"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=membre&p=477"},"modified":"2025-12-10T05:35:58","modified_gmt":"2025-12-10T05:35:58","slug":"mathieu-paquita","status":"publish","type":"membre","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/mathieu-paquita/","title":{"rendered":"Mathieu & Paquita"},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-477","membre","type-membre","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":{"binome_seul":true,"descriptif":"<p>Une fée incroyable qui conjugue à merveille — et au millimètre — expérience visiteurs, design d’intérieur, parpaings, ponçage, peinture et même céramique ! Si tous les espaces dans lesquels vous êtes accueillis sont aussi chouettos, c’est grâce à Paquita !</p>\n<p>Un oeil rigoureux et aguerri qui veille à ce que toute cette affaire roule — qui time, qui chiffre et qui projette L’Hermitage d’aujourd’hui et de demain. Ça, c’est le job de Mathieu !</p>\n","photo":{"ID":474,"id":474,"title":"Mathieu & Paquita","filename":"Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","filesize":45974,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/mathieu-paquita/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"mathieu-paquita","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":470,"date":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","modified":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":545,"height":489,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita-300x269.jpeg","medium-width":300,"medium-height":269,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","medium_large-width":545,"medium_large-height":489,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","large-width":545,"large-height":489,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","1536x1536-width":545,"1536x1536-height":489,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mathieu-Paquita.jpeg","2048x2048-width":545,"2048x2048-height":489}},"domaine_daction":"","activite_principale":"Gestion du domaine"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre/477","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/membre"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=477"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":478,"date":"2025-12-10T04:38:42","date_gmt":"2025-12-10T04:38:42","guid":{"rendered":"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=membre&p=478"},"modified":"2025-12-10T05:35:35","modified_gmt":"2025-12-10T05:35:35","slug":"charlotte-sylvie","status":"publish","type":"membre","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/charlotte-sylvie/","title":{"rendered":"Charlotte & Sylvie"},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-478","membre","type-membre","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":{"binome_seul":true,"descriptif":"<p>Il y a ces premiers sourires que l’on voit en passant les portes de L’Hermitage, et ceux que l’on ne découvre que le matin au<br />\npetit déjeuner…</p>\n<p>Charlotte, c’est ce rire éclatant qui donne tout son sens à la « convivialité façon Hermitage » ! Ce sera la première à vous servir un café fraîchement moulu à votre arrivée !</p>\n<p>Pas une pièce de L’Hermitage sans que Sylvie n’y soit passée. Pas un lit qu’elle n’aura bordé au carré avant que vous ne vous y nichiez. Pas un petit-déjeuner qu’elle ne vous aura préparé aux aurores. Sylvie, c’est notre (et votre) Marie Poppins !</p>\n","photo":{"ID":471,"id":471,"title":"Charlotte & Sylvie","filename":"Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","filesize":60823,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/charlotte-sylvie/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"charlotte-sylvie","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":470,"date":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","modified":"2025-12-10 04:35:02","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":572,"height":461,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie-300x242.jpeg","medium-width":300,"medium-height":242,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","medium_large-width":572,"medium_large-height":461,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","large-width":572,"large-height":461,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","1536x1536-width":572,"1536x1536-height":461,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Charlotte-Sylvie.jpeg","2048x2048-width":572,"2048x2048-height":461}},"domaine_daction":"","activite_principale":"Restauration & Hôtellerie"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre/478","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/membre"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=478"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":479,"date":"2025-12-10T04:40:38","date_gmt":"2025-12-10T04:40:38","guid":{"rendered":"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=membre&p=479"},"modified":"2025-12-10T05:34:48","modified_gmt":"2025-12-10T05:34:48","slug":"sarah-claire","status":"publish","type":"membre","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/sarah-claire/","title":{"rendered":"Sarah & Claire"},"featured_media":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-479","membre","type-membre","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":{"binome_seul":true,"descriptif":"<p>Chez nous, on ne badine pas avec les accords de Paris – Du champ à l'assiette, c'est – ici – une réalité ! »<br />\nC’est d’abord Claire qui est à l’initiative de notre charte alimentaire. Le « comment du pourquoi vous avez ce que vous avez dans votre assiette » c’est elle ! Et ce job, elle le prend à cœur en étant particulièrement investie dans notre AMAP locale.</p>\n<p>Et c’est aussi Sarah et son équipe, qui vous mitonneront des petits plats tous frais — Unanimement validés / certifiés / tamponnés « Maison Hermitage » !</p>\n<p>Mais ce sont également Charline, Raphaël, Edwige qui vous feront joyeusement naviguer entre cueillette, aquaponie et pédagogie.</p>\n","photo":{"ID":475,"id":475,"title":"Sahra & Claire","filename":"Sahra-Claire.jpeg","filesize":55234,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire.jpeg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/membre/jean-sylvia/sahra-claire/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"sahra-claire","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":470,"date":"2025-12-10 04:35:03","modified":"2025-12-10 04:35:03","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":683,"height":442,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire-300x194.jpeg","medium-width":300,"medium-height":194,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire.jpeg","medium_large-width":640,"medium_large-height":414,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire.jpeg","large-width":640,"large-height":414,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire.jpeg","1536x1536-width":683,"1536x1536-height":442,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sahra-Claire.jpeg","2048x2048-width":683,"2048x2048-height":442}},"domaine_daction":"","activite_principale":"Activités"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre/479","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/membre"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/membre"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=479"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}}]}]]}]]}]
